{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121192646399-1121_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261121193233\"/><p>馬魯古省海底發生地震。</p><p>印尼氣象、氣候和地球物理局指，馬魯古省東北43公里海域周六（21日）下午4時42分，發生黎克特制7.2級地震，震源深度125公里。預計不會有海嘯風險。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:43:53.595599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:26:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:24.497304+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:24.497304+00:00","content_hash":"01db8d46e15cd4beb25a9341646fbc753a84c029fcbcb6128724b4fb25d9b71e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}